# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, whose handlers keep the lists in the process (KeptLists): it
# adds src/Infrastructure/Postgres (AppDbContext over the modules'
# configurations, the repository, the translation of failures, the repository
# in memory for the handlers' scenarios), the repository's contract
# (src/Shared.Persistence, with its package), the migration job
# src/App/App.Migrate, the command scope in BuildingBlocks, the store failures
# middleware, and the module's table: the configuration of Item
# (Todo.Domain/Configurations) and the specifications that pick items
# (Todo.Application/Specifications). Beside the composition root and the build
# files it changes the example's own business code, as the natural code of a
# database asks: the item gets its key and its list (Item.cs), the handlers take
# IRepository<Item> in place of KeptLists, and their scenarios run over the
# repository in memory.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-http-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples-proto
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/App.Host.Tests.csproj
change src/Middleware/Middleware.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Todo.Domain.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Entities/Item.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Todo.Application.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/TodoModule.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/AddItemHandler.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/ListItemsHandler.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application.Tests/Todo.Application.Tests.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application.Tests/Commands/Steps/ItemListsSteps.cs
delete src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/KeptLists.cs
change Directory.Packages.props
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
